{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:36:47+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:36:47+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Schindler Holding AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Switzerland","city":"Hergiswil","website":"https://group.schindler.com","employees":67489,"summary":"Schindler Holding AG engages in the production, installation, maintenance, and modernization of elevators, escalators, and moving walks worldwide. It offers Schindler PORT, a transit management system; CleanMobility solutions; Schindler R.I.S.E, a robotic installation system; Schindler MetaCore which enables buildings to be repurposed and their functionality to be reconfigured; Schindler CLIMB Lift, a self-climbing system; Schindler X8; Digital Twin; and BuildingMinds, a cloud based SaaS platform that lets users monitor the performance of a real estate portfolio. In addition, the company provides digital services; and Building Information Modeling which provides traceability and insights throughout the project life cycle, including planning, design, construction, operation, and maintenance. The company was founded in 1874 and is headquartered in Hergiswil, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Schindler Holding AG se consacre à la production, à l'installation, à la maintenance et à la modernisation d'ascenseurs, d'escaliers mécaniques et de trottoirs roulants dans le monde entier. Il offre Schindler PORT, un système de gestion de transport en commun; Solutions CleanMobility; Schindler R.I.S.E, un système d'installation robotique; Schindler MetaCore qui permet de réutiliser les bâtiments et de reconfigurer leurs fonctionnalités; Schindler CLIMB Lift, un système d'auto-escalade; Schindler X8; Digital Twin; et BuildingMinds, une plate-forme SaaS basée sur le cloud qui permet aux utilisateurs de surveiller les performances réelles. En outre, l'entreprise fournit des services numériques; et Building Information Modeling qui fournit une traçabilité et des informations tout au long du cycle de vie du projet, y compris la planification, la conception, la construction, l'exploitation et la maintenance."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":31261685760,"shares_outstanding":39912607,"trailing_pe":32.497223,"forward_pe":25.16216,"price_to_book":6.183085,"ev_to_ebitda":16.91,"ev_to_revenue":2.469,"dividend_yield":0.0222,"payout_ratio":0.6401,"beta_yahoo":0.789},"targets":{"current_price":292.8,"mean":303.66666,"median":297.0,"high":350.0,"low":269.0,"n_analysts":6,"reco_mean":2.66667,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-22"],"eps_avg":2.65,"eps_low":2.65,"eps_high":2.65,"revenue_avg":2946004700,"ex_dividend":"2026-03-26","dividend_date":"2025-03-31"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.0,"institutions_pct":0.4942,"institutions_float_pct":0.4942,"institutions_n":359,"institutions":[{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":215,"value":62951,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"First Eagle Funds-First Eagle Global Fund","pct":0.0396,"shares":1583092,"value":463529318,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0149,"shares":597479,"value":174941843,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0083},{"name":"First Eagle Funds-First Eagle Overseas Fund","pct":0.0134000005,"shares":535676,"value":156845926,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0098,"shares":390344,"value":114292718,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0037},{"name":"Fidelity Investment Trust-Fidelity Series International Growth Fund","pct":0.0094,"shares":374448,"value":109638369,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":-0.0328},{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST X-MFS International Intrinsic Value Fund","pct":0.009,"shares":359413,"value":105236122,"date":"2026